  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ヤマブキの　シルフカンパニー\nほんしゃ　ビルの　ドアロックを\nはずす　カードタイプの　カギ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "노랑시티의 실프주식회사\n본사 빌딩의 도어록을\n해제하는 카드 타입의 열쇠.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "卡片型的鑰匙。\n能打開位於金黃市的\n西爾佛公司總部的門鎖。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une carte magnétique pouvant ouvrir les portes\ndu siège de la Sylphe SARL à Safrania.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Schlüsselkarte, mit der die Türen im Hauptsitz\nder Silph Company in Saffronia City geöffnet werden\nkönnen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Esta tarjeta permite abrir las puertas de la Oficina\nCentral de Silph S. A. en Ciudad Azafrán.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chiave a scheda per sbloccare le porte nella sede\ndella Silph S.p.A. a Zafferanopoli.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A card key that unlocks doors in Silph Co.’s head\noffice in Saffron City.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ヤマブキの　シルフカンパニー\n本社　ビルの　ドアロックを\nはずす　カードタイプの　カギ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用来打开位于金黄市的\n西尔佛公司总部大厦门锁的\n卡片式钥匙。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
